Generation","page":4,"quote":"Ragas 0.95 0.78 0.70 GPT Score 0.72 0.52 0.63 GPT Ranking 0.54 0.40 0.52 Table 1: Agreement with human annotators in pairwise comparisons of faithfulness, answer relevance and con- text relevance, using the WikEval dataset (accuracy)."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_086f8765c281ae00","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":4,"quote":"generated texts such as “fluency” (Wang et al., 2023a) Some of these criteria are generic to vector RAG systems and not relevant to global sensemaking, such as “context relevance”, “faithfulness”, and “answer relevance” (RAGAS, Es et al."},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"743155d9b0541c99_c_8f3a31bea776841b","docId":"743155d9b0541c99","docTitle":"2401.15391_MultiHop_RAG_Benchmarking_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Multi_Hop","page":8,"quote":"In addition, recent ad- vancements have been made in automated RAG evaluation tools, such as ARES (Saad-Falcon et al., 2023) and RAGAS (Es et al., 2023)."},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"bd72eebf611df136_c_a4081598f748285a","docId":"bd72eebf611df136","docTitle":"2410.05779_LightRAG_Simple_and_Fast_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":11,"quote":"Shahul Es, Jithin James, Luis Espinosa Anke, and Steven Schockaert. Ragas: Automated evaluation of retrieval augmented generation."},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_3e98239e329f5734","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":1,"quote":"With Ragas, we put forward a suite of metrics which can be used to evaluate these different dimensions without having to rely on ground truth human annotations."},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_ab9bef661a510741","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"Our evaluation on WikiEval has shown that the predictions from Ragas are closely aligned with human predictions, especially for faithfulness and answer relevance."},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_5c3e75fced03988b","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":1,"quote":"The Ragas frame- work provides an integration with both llama-index and Langchain, the most widely used frameworks for building RAG solutions, thus enabling devel- opers to easily integrate Ragas into their standard workflow."},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_bb9ffaaa845d58ad","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":14,"quote":"Concur- rently, state-of-the-art automated tools like RAGAS [164], ARES [165], and TruLens8 employ LLMs to adjudicate the quality scores."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"730f1a9f38d16689_c_b1f6aee6dfa7c009","docId":"730f1a9f38d16689","docTitle":"2404.16130_From_Local_to_Global_A_Graph_RAG_Approach_to_Query_Focused_Summarizati","page":13,"quote":"Ragas: Automated evaluation of retrieval augmented generation."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_b3d41f0162312809","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"To put the results in context, we compare our proposed metrics (shown as Ragas in Table 1) with two baseline methods."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"6c24762a3f277fd1_c_b8bf8852dd017519","docId":"6c24762a3f277fd1","docTitle":"2309.15217_Ragas_Automated_Evaluation_of_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation","page":5,"quote":"For faithfulness, the Ragas prediction are in general highly accurate."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_7e3171510400ba2c","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":20,"quote":"Schockaert, “Ragas: Au- tomated evaluation of retrieval augmented generation,” arXiv preprint arXiv:2309.15217, 2023."},{"id":"